        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579650/extras/279e318adfa8acf084e4f1344057c914.poster.avif?t=1764081610\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579650/extras/279e318adfa8acf084e4f1344057c914.mp4?t=1764081610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NULLPTR is a real-time tactical hacking puzzle, nominated as a finalist for Innovation and Best Brazilian Game at Gamescom LATAM 2024, where every action you take reshapes the challenge ahead. Infiltrate megacorp servers, reroute connections, collect valuable data, and outmaneuver adaptive defenses, all while racing against the clock and the relentless threat of reactive sentinels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579650/extras/c35b5c4edce55baabab42929a8d52c78.poster.avif?t=1764081610\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579650/extras/c35b5c4edce55baabab42929a8d52c78.mp4?t=1764081610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time tactical puzzles</strong> – Every move matters as adaptive defense systems react dynamically to your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20-second infiltration window</strong> – Plan carefully and execute quickly before the trace monitor locks you out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reversible routes</strong> – Your movement leaves behind a visible trace; retrace your steps to erase it and reduce your exposure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stack memory system</strong> – Store, reorder, and rewrite data nodes to alter the environment and exploit the system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive defenses</strong> – Sentinels, gates and firewalls respond to your behavior, turning obstacles into potential tools if used cleverly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emergent gameplay</strong> – Discover loopholes, bend the rules, and transform threats into opportunities through creative play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging progression</strong> – Over 125 handcrafted stages across four powerful megacorporations, each with unique security systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost runs</strong> – Complete servers without detection to record your best times and prove mastery of the system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyberpunk aesthetic</strong> – A minimalist, high-contrast style inspired by classic terminals and retro hacking culture.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579650/extras/279e318adfa8acf084e4f1344057c914.poster.avif?t=1764081610\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579650/extras/279e318adfa8acf084e4f1344057c914.mp4?t=1764081610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NULLPTR is a real-time tactical hacking puzzle, nominated as a finalist for Innovation and Best Brazilian Game at Gamescom LATAM 2024, where every action you take reshapes the challenge ahead. Infiltrate megacorp servers, reroute connections, collect valuable data, and outmaneuver adaptive defenses, all while racing against the clock and the relentless threat of reactive sentinels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579650/extras/c35b5c4edce55baabab42929a8d52c78.poster.avif?t=1764081610\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579650/extras/c35b5c4edce55baabab42929a8d52c78.mp4?t=1764081610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time tactical puzzles</strong> – Every move matters as adaptive defense systems react dynamically to your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20-second infiltration window</strong> – Plan carefully and execute quickly before the trace monitor locks you out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reversible routes</strong> – Your movement leaves behind a visible trace; retrace your steps to erase it and reduce your exposure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stack memory system</strong> – Store, reorder, and rewrite data nodes to alter the environment and exploit the system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive defenses</strong> – Sentinels, gates and firewalls respond to your behavior, turning obstacles into potential tools if used cleverly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emergent gameplay</strong> – Discover loopholes, bend the rules, and transform threats into opportunities through creative play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging progression</strong> – Over 125 handcrafted stages across four powerful megacorporations, each with unique security systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost runs</strong> – Complete servers without detection to record your best times and prove mastery of the system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyberpunk aesthetic</strong> – A minimalist, high-contrast style inspired by classic terminals and retro hacking culture.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "A real-time tactical hacking puzzle where every move reshapes the challenge. Infiltrate megacorp servers, reroute connections, gather valuable data, and outsmart evolving defenses, all while racing against the clock and the ever-present threat of adaptive sentinels.",
